{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 7, :comments ["<b>And you</b> — to Him is the return to Elohim, your Elohim. He was your helper to restore you to Him, and this is the meaning: \"And you, by your Elohim, return\" — and hope to Him, and do not rely on your wealth or on your strength, for the strength was from Him to you, the wealth as well."], :book :hosea, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 12, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Hosea -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/daat/olam_hatanah/mefaresh.asp?book=15&perek=1&mefaresh=ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:51:00.288300131Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}